[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_f8esa"]
script = ExtResource("1_6mdjr")
random_lines = Array[String](["That damn Ume stole my pants. REVENGE WILL BE MINE.", "Sighhh- Oh hey there didn't see ya.", "HUP two three four HUP two three four.", "96, 97, 98, 99, ONE HUNDRED well that's my daily workout done.", "What do you mean, am I okay? Pshhh of course never been better…", "Sorry Sakura, this show is booked out. THE GUN SHOW THAT IS (flexing).", "Man seeing Mio run like that. If only… (sniffle) sorry I need some time.", "(looking into the sky) My Selena will you ever get better…", "Lots of rain huh? Hopefully the dike holds up…", "I could beat Kenji in an arm wrestle any day of the week don't even try me.", "RAHHHH THIS RAIN WILL NOT EXTINGUISH MY FIERY SPIRIT.", "If the kami really do exist, why do they punish m- us?", "And then I said CARPENTER? I HARDLY KNOW HER.", "You know Shizu-hime was a carpenter.", "What? I'm way better than Kenji. I literally make his boats. ", "That Genshin is babbling nonsense again. If Mizuahara really existed…", "Hey Sakura how does this sound, “Selena your beauty carves the waves in my heart”.", "Yeah Sato's fishing rod? I kinda was the guy who made that (flexes).", "I'm sick of everyone pitying me. It's not like she'll die… I hope.", "Selena loves my positivity! I gotta keep a can-do attitude for her!", "I wonder what's the secret to Chiyo's age? Maybe it could help Selena…", "That little rascal Mio always trying to get piggy back rides out of me.", "YEAHHHHHHHHH…", "Did you know my name means loyalty? I'll forever be loyal to my dear Selena!!!", "The bridge? Yeah me and my dad made it (flexes).", "This hammer? Yeah I made it (flexes).", "Kenji came around and he called me “The hot shot” wonder where he got that name from.", "I really hope I didn't skimp out too much on those dikes.", "Surely mud and bamboo will be stronger than stone. ", "If the dikes break I'll just wrestle with the river! (flexes). If it breaks…"])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dn6pv6t3qvn8d"

